TA390
=====

TA390 (the radio firmware, the TA390 Windows program and the TA390 Android app) is derived
from the OpenGD77 firmware and is distributed under the same terms as OpenGD77, reproduced
below. In particular, ANY COMMERCIAL USE IS FORBIDDEN (clause 4).

TA390 is NOT an official OpenGD77 release. It is not made, endorsed or supported by the
OpenGD77 developers.

Modifications and programs: Copyright (C) 2026 TB1YZC

The DMR audio codec (AMBE) and the TYT donor firmware are not part of TA390 and are not
distributed.

Licences of the third party components (FreeRTOS, STMicroelectronics STM32 HAL and USB Device
Library, Arm CMSIS, libusb, APRS symbols) are in the LISANSLAR folder.

